<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Enhancement Shamans in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our Tier 15 set empowers <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=17364/stormstrike">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_shaman_stormstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormstrike</span></a> to give us 2 stacks of <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=51530/maelstrom-weapon">
