<del></del></span>Reputation Items for Enhancement Shamans in Phase 3</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. We recommend you prioritize the new Faction for Phase 3, <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
